               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Declare class Execution::WhileDoing ctx  { L\"opening file fred\" };",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "This would set a thread local variable (really somehow linked list of them) - but needs to be cheap.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Then - while doing any exception (StringException class) - we grab all the TLS stored WhileDoing objects and copy them into excetion being thrown.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Then overide (automatically) the message generated:",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "\"While WHILE_MSG\"  + \" \" + BASIC_EXCEPTION_MSG;",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Only modest cost - and probably pretty good results on message generation?",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
                  "type" : "doc",
                  "version" : 1
               },
